    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TWA\nTWA Douglas\nAirliner\nFastest in the\nair\nSlowest to land-",
      "POST CARD\nAll TWA Airliners are equipped with Air Brakes,\nlocated on the under side of the trailing edge of the\nwing, reducing landing speed to less than 58 m.p.h\nwith a full load and reducing the necessary landing area\nto one-third of that which would be necessary without\nthese new Air Brakes.\nThese Air Brakes represent a\ngive the\nplane a safety factor heretofore unknown in commercial\ntransport flying.\n450\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\n2015.1661526"
